cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenCDA-MARL, please cite the framework paper below. The
  preference-conditioned learners (PCMASAC / PCMAPPO / PCMATD3) build on
  PCMA; please also cite the PCMA paper listed under references when you
  use them.
